  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-01-26T01:34:50.040Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I've been running into an issue where the eye starts clipping through the eyelid when the eyes are closed and the head's moved while the eyes continue to track whatever they were looking at last. I've checked the eye rotation limits in Unity and even if I combine the values of down + left/right, I can't get into a situation where that clipping occurs. This leads me to believe that the eye limits aren't being respected.",
